{#
  Dried-flower botanicals drawn as inline SVG. Every colour comes from the theme through
  CSS classes (style.css → "botanicals"), so they follow the user's palette.
#}

{# Horizontal divider: lavender sprig ← twine bow → wheat & baby's breath #}
